Example 5: Smartphone (Hybrid Inheritance)

```python
class ElectronicDevice:
    def power_on(self):
        print("Device powered on")

class Camera:
    def take_photo(self):
        print("Photo captured")

class CommunicationDevice(ElectronicDevice):
    def make_call(self):
        print("Calling...")

class Smartphone(CommunicationDevice, Camera):
    def browse_internet(self):
        print("Browsing the internet")

phone = Smartphone()
phone.power_on()
phone.make_call()
phone.take_photo()
phone.browse_internet()
```
*Real-life link:* A Smartphone combines features of a communication device and a camera — a real hybrid inheritance example.

